## Problem: Binary Search (Easy-Medium)
*Link:* https://leetcode.com/problems/binary-search/

### Approach
Maintain a search range [left, right]. Repeatedly check the middle element: if it matches the target, return its index; if it's smaller, search the right half; if larger, search the left half. Stop when the range is empty.

### Complexity
•⁠  ⁠Time: O(log n)
•⁠  ⁠Space: O(1)

### Notes
Requires the input array to already be sorted, which this problem guarantees.
